75,\"title\":\"Only Andy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dbAYdreGtfWKmshEGgym4Kparvv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yKTydYxiC4VP3pGTPnIpI1darkx.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Many of us experience sexual desires in many different shapes and forms, yet there continues to be a certain stigma about expressing them openly. Adult worker, Andy Lee, and his co-workers share their own insightful and interesting perspectives on the adult industry in a bid to inspire people to open up to each other, and to further shed some light on the frequently misunderstood adult industry.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":509840,\"title\":\"Mondo Homo: A Study of French Gay Porn in the '70s\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8xce458AC0RmzPBKkZlKNccFtDN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p9GePx5MPwB9WehZ4Y1qaCkmTBp.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Between 1975 and 1983 a new kind of film could be seen in French cinema : home-grown gay pornography. The films were shot in 16mm and most of them were passed and given certificates by the CNC (National Cinema Centre). They were screened in a small number of Parisian cinemas dedicated to gay pornographic films : Le Dragon, La Marotte and Le Hollywood Boulevard as well as several in the provinces. They were essentially the work of three production companies : Les Films de La Troïka (Norbert Terry), AMT Productions (Anne-Marie Tensi) and Les Films du Vertbois (principally Jacques Scandelari). The genre met an untimely end with the advent of video, the last being made in 1983 \\\"Mon ami, mon amour (My friend, my lover)\\\". Since then, gay pornography has not been screened in French cinemas. This film is the result of five years of painstaking research and investigation. It features extensive interviews with the directors and actors illustrated by numerous extracts from their films.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270698,\"title\":\"I'm a Porn Star\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p5sRhu92BxooLfjYCl56MR1zWWN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uWW6bLyvXt7TpHe6VYRneFficI7.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"I'm a Porn Star follows the lives of guys in the neighborhood who are likely a lot more famous than you - at least on the Internet. There are an estimated 370 million pornographic websites on-line. Porn is now a thirteen BILLION dollar business. So who's doing all this moonlighting? Turns out -- probably some people you know.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":17731,\"title\":\"The Fluffer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jYKeDJ0PgVBoSUVq4aXkXrapsjA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pNUVUFyf5UTAaaoh9k7UK6FXmez.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Self-effacing, boyish Sean moves to LA to pursue a career in movies but finds it tougher than he imagined. He stumbles onto porn star Johnny Rebel - a handsome, muscled dream of men and women alike - who awakens Sean’s deep obsession.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475930,\"title\":\"Knife+Heart\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Aodlp3TH6FBti9igUCt8f5KS7Nb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o6rSSDdXkQRGCYKTkwiFjWG7qov.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the summer of 1979, gay porn producer Anne sets out to film her most ambitious film yet, but her actors are picked off, one by one, by a mysterious killer.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":105789,\"title\":\"Going Down in La-La Land\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tbgH8Fn3DPJzF5E7uxyjLAoPKIT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qaZ8CXv0thtQqZGRNbHuuZ9NlgT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fresh face comes to Hollywood to act in movies but only the gay porn studios are eager to provide him with work.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":347870,\"title\":\"Slash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hmrhRg05zoR16hGeSfiMKIRpf6y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nIB8kKXNukQEqPKB8nsfcemAShs.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Freshman Neil's Vanguard stories are all he cares about...until he meets the older Julia, who pushes him to put his own fan fic online. When the website's moderator takes a special interest in Neil's work, it opens up a whole new universe.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":739997,\"title\":\"Goodbye Seventies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rwJY7y8LzhDJgRV3z1V3wOXYqxW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9pn6E7W3sjHj276KGvlHlpUd2ur.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the 1970s, the golden age of gay pornography in New York City, a promising chorus boy is injured and told he will never dance again. Distraught and unimpressed with the \\\"art\\\" films playing seedy Times Square theaters, he gets his friends and lovers together and they start making their own hardcore movies. Against all odds the films are wildly successful until drugs, AIDS and cheap video technology bring it all crashing down\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":90241,\"title\":\"All Boys\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lQOHyDHunXXBgyOTFDAQ9UBYGd4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x4mvGMoDK3ZXXVqTKIA7U6vkJZP.jpg\",\"rating\":3.9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look behind the scenes of the Czech gay porn boom.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}